{% doc %}
  @prompt
    Create a compact mobile-first FAQ section.
    
    This section will be viewed primarily on iPhone screens.
    
    Mobile readability is the highest priority.
    
    Never allow question text to wrap into more than 2 lines.
    
    If necessary:
    
    reduce font size
    reduce letter spacing
    reduce font weight slightly
    
    Never increase row height.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Header:
    
    FAQ
    
    Questions Before You Start
    
    Everything you need to know before starting your transformation.
    
    Maximum headline width:
    280px
    
    Headline size:
    34px desktop
    28px mobile
    
    Subheadline:
    15px
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    FAQ Container
    
    Single rounded container.
    
    Background:
    rgba(255,255,255,0.02)
    
    Border:
    1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08)
    
    Radius:
    28px
    
    Overflow:
    hidden
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Rows
    
    Height:
    68px
    
    Padding:
    0 18px
    
    Display:
    flex
    
    align-items:
    center
    
    justify-content:
    space-between
    
    Divider:
    1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06)
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Question Typography
    
    Font size:
    15px
    
    Font weight:
    800
    
    Letter spacing:
    1px
    
    Uppercase.
    
    Maximum width:
    72%
    
    Text alignment:
    left
    
    Questions may occupy:
    
    one line
    or two lines maximum
    
    Never allow:
    
    three lines
    four lines
    vertical word stacking
    
    Reduce font size automatically if text exceeds two lines.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Plus Icon
    
    Size:
    28px
    
    Color:
    rgba(255,255,255,0.82)
    
    Always remain aligned to the right edge.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Questions
    
    HOW DOES IT WORK?
    
    WHAT DO I GET?
    
    WHY LURVOX?
    
    GYM OR HOME?
    
    DO I NEED SUPPLEMENTS?
    
    WHAT HAPPENS AFTER?
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Animation
    
    Background fade:
    220ms
    
    Plus rotation:
    250ms
    
    Answer reveal:
    280ms fade and slide.
    
    No bounce.
    
    No spring animations.
    
    No scaling.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Most important rule:
    
    This FAQ must be optimized for a 390px mobile screen width.
    
    Never allow the text to become a vertical column of words.
    
    The result should feel compact, premium and engineered., Update the existing FAQ section.
    
    Keep the exact layout and structure but refine it to match the rest of the LURVOX website design language.
    
    Use the existing LURVOX color system:
    
    Background: #050505
    Primary accent: #FF6200
    Hover accent: #FF7A1A
    Text: #FFFFFF
    Secondary text: rgba(255,255,255,0.72)
    Border color: rgba(255,255,255,0.08)
    Glow color: rgba(255,98,0,0.15)
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    FAQ Container
    
    Place the entire FAQ inside a single premium rounded rectangle container.
    
    Container background:
    rgba(255,255,255,0.015)
    
    Border:
    1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08)
    
    Border hover:
    1px solid rgba(255,98,0,0.35)
    
    Border radius:
    28px
    
    Padding:
    22px mobile
    36px desktop
    
    Subtle premium inner shadow.
    
    No glassmorphism.
    No blur effects.
    No gradients.
    
    The container should feel similar to premium automotive interfaces from Mercedes-Benz and Porsche configurators.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Typography
    
    Reduce overall text size slightly.
    
    Headline:
    26px mobile
    
    Subheadline:
    14px mobile
    
    Question text:
    14px mobile
    
    Letter spacing:
    0.8px
    
    Allow merchants to adjust:
    
    headline size
    question size
    subheading size
    row spacing
    container radius
    
    directly from theme settings.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Accordion Rows
    
    Height:
    64px
    
    Row border:
    1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.06)
    
    Spacing between rows:
    0px
    
    Question aligned left.
    Icon aligned right.
    
    Everything perfectly centered vertically.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Accordion Animation
    
    Accordion opening must feel premium and extremely smooth.
    
    When opened:
    
    • plus icon rotates 45 degrees into an X
    • answer fades in smoothly
    • answer slides downward naturally
    • container height expands smoothly
    
    Animation timing:
    
    icon rotation:
    250ms
    
    height expansion:
    420ms
    
    text fade:
    320ms
    
    Use ease-in-out transitions.
    
    No snapping.
    No jumping.
    No bouncing.
    No lag.
    
    The interaction should feel similar to the FAQ animations on premium automotive websites.
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Hover and Interaction
    
    Desktop hover:
    
    slight orange border glow
    slight text brightness increase
    
    Mobile tap:
    
    brief orange highlight pulse
    smooth transition back to normal state
    
    ━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
    
    Most important requirement:
    
    The FAQ must feel like it belongs to the existing LURVOX website and not like a separate component added later.
    
    It should feel engineered, minimal and premium while remaining compact and highly readable on mobile devices.
{% enddoc %}
{% assign ai_gen_id = block.id | replace: '_', '' | downcase %}

{% style %}
  .ai-faq-section-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: block;
    width: {{ block.settings.desktop_width_percent }}%;
    max-width: 100%;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: {{ block.settings.section_padding_top }}px {{ block.settings.section_padding_horizontal }}px {{ block.settings.section_padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-faq-header-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    margin-bottom: {{ block.settings.header_spacing }}px;
  }

  .ai-faq-eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_weight }};
    color: {{ block.settings.eyebrow_color }};
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.8px;
  }

  .ai-faq-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.headline_size_mobile }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.headline_weight }};
    color: {{ block.settings.headline_color }};
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    max-width: {{ block.settings.headline_max_width }}px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-faq-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      font-size: {{ block.settings.headline_size_desktop }}px;
    }
  }

  .ai-faq-subheadline-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.subheadline_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.subheadline_weight }};
    color: {{ block.settings.subheadline_color }};
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .ai-faq-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    background: {{ block.settings.container_background }};
    border: {{ block.settings.container_border_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.container_border_color }};
    border-radius: {{ block.settings.container_radius }}px;
    overflow: hidden;
    padding: {{ block.settings.container_padding_mobile }}px;
    box-shadow: inset 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
    transition: border-color 300ms ease-in-out;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .ai-faq-container-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      padding: {{ block.settings.container_padding_desktop }}px;
    }
  }

  .ai-faq-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
    border-color: {{ block.settings.container_border_hover_color }};
  }

  .ai-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    border-bottom: {{ block.settings.divider_width }}px solid {{ block.settings.divider_color }};
  }

  .ai-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .ai-faq-question-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    height: {{ block.settings.row_height }}px;
    padding: 0 {{ block.settings.row_padding_horizontal }}px;
    cursor: pointer;
    background: transparent;
    transition: background 220ms ease-in-out;
  }

  @media (hover: hover) {
    .ai-faq-question-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover {
      background: {{ block.settings.row_hover_background }};
    }

    .ai-faq-question-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-faq-question-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
      color: {{ block.settings.question_hover_color }};
    }

    .ai-faq-question-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}:hover .ai-faq-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
      stroke: {{ block.settings.icon_hover_color }};
    }
  }

  @media (hover: none) {
    .ai-faq-question-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}:active {
      background: {{ block.settings.row_tap_background }};
    }
  }

  .ai-faq-question-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.question_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.question_weight }};
    letter-spacing: {{ block.settings.question_letter_spacing }}px;
    color: {{ block.settings.question_color }};
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-align: left;
    max-width: 72%;
    line-height: 1.2;
    overflow: hidden;
    display: -webkit-box;
    -webkit-line-clamp: 2;
    -webkit-box-orient: vertical;
    transition: color 220ms ease-in-out;
  }

  .ai-faq-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    width: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    height: {{ block.settings.icon_size }}px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    transition: transform {{ block.settings.icon_rotation_duration }}ms ease-in-out;
  }

  .ai-faq-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} svg {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    stroke: {{ block.settings.icon_color }};
    stroke-width: 2;
    transition: stroke 220ms ease-in-out;
  }

  .ai-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active .ai-faq-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    transform: rotate(45deg);
  }

  .ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-height: 0;
    overflow: hidden;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity {{ block.settings.answer_fade_duration }}ms ease-in-out, max-height {{ block.settings.answer_height_duration }}ms ease-in-out;
  }

  .ai-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active .ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    max-height: 600px;
    opacity: 1;
    padding: 0 {{ block.settings.row_padding_horizontal }}px {{ block.settings.answer_padding_bottom }}px;
  }

  .ai-faq-answer-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    font-size: {{ block.settings.answer_size }}px;
    font-weight: {{ block.settings.answer_weight }};
    color: {{ block.settings.answer_color }};
    line-height: 1.6;
    transform: translateY(-8px);
    transition: transform {{ block.settings.answer_height_duration }}ms ease-in-out;
  }

  .ai-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}.active .ai-faq-answer-content-{{ ai_gen_id }} {
    transform: translateY(0);
  }
{% endstyle %}

<faq-accordion-{{ ai_gen_id }} class="ai-faq-section-{{ ai_gen_id }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  <div class="ai-faq-header-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% if block.settings.eyebrow != blank %}
      <div class="ai-faq-eyebrow-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.eyebrow }}</div>
    {% endif %}
    {% if block.settings.headline != blank %}
      <h2 class="ai-faq-headline-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.headline }}</h2>
    {% endif %}
    {% if block.settings.subheadline != blank %}
      <div class="ai-faq-subheadline-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ block.settings.subheadline }}</div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>

  <div class="ai-faq-container-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
    {% for i in (1..6) %}
      {% liquid
        assign question_key = 'question_' | append: i
        assign answer_key = 'answer_' | append: i
        assign question = block.settings[question_key]
        assign answer = block.settings[answer_key]
      %}
      {% if question != blank %}
        <div class="ai-faq-item-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-faq-item>
          <div class="ai-faq-question-wrapper-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-faq-trigger>
            <div class="ai-faq-question-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ question }}</div>
            <div class="ai-faq-icon-{{ ai_gen_id }}">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
                <line x1="12" y1="5" x2="12" y2="19"></line>
                <line x1="5" y1="12" x2="19" y2="12"></line>
              </svg>
            </div>
          </div>
          {% if answer != blank %}
            <div class="ai-faq-answer-{{ ai_gen_id }}" data-faq-answer>
              <div class="ai-faq-answer-content-{{ ai_gen_id }}">{{ answer }}</div>
            </div>
          {% endif %}
        </div>
      {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</faq-accordion-{{ ai_gen_id }}>

<script>
  (function() {
    class FaqAccordion{{ ai_gen_id }} extends HTMLElement {
      constructor() {
        super();
      }

      connectedCallback() {
        this.items = this.querySelectorAll('[data-faq-item]');
        this.setupEventListeners();
      }

      setupEventListeners() {
        this.items.forEach((item) => {
          const trigger = item.querySelector('[data-faq-trigger]');
          trigger.addEventListener('click', () => {
            const isActive = item.classList.contains('active');
            
            this.items.forEach((otherItem) => {
              if (otherItem !== item) {
                otherItem.classList.remove('active');
              }
            });

            if (isActive) {
              item.classList.remove('active');
            } else {
              item.classList.add('active');
            }
          });
        });
      }
    }

    customElements.define('faq-accordion-{{ ai_gen_id }}', FaqAccordion{{ ai_gen_id }});
  })();
</script>

